    "body": "复核当前 exact head `c328bbf1bc4084caeeabad613afda8ca00539e46`：**substantive PASS，未发现 P0/P1 blocker；可按 APPROVE-with-P2 处理。**\n\n已确认本轮 MIT closure、PEP 639 / wheel+sdist 许可闭包、release policy `1.2.0` append-only、原创 Skill 仅更新当前 license 状态且不改变 manifest/package bytes/hash/version/lifecycle、生产 Projection 仍为空；main/develop rulesets `23192054` / `23192001` 当前均 active、无 bypass，merge method / approval / required checks 与 DEVELOPMENT 5.3 一致。M14-005 仍保持 BLOCKED，source-CI attestation 缺口被如实保留，没有提前 freeze source、创建 release branch/tag 或激活 curated topology。当前 exact-head CI / governance 均通过。\n\n两个非阻塞 P2 建议：\n\n1. **收口 Risk Ledger 的旧状态。** `M14-SKILL-001` 仍写“`M0-007` 与生产空 Projection index 继续阻断 Skill 发行”，但本 PR 已提议 `M0-007: DONE`；建议改成“license blocker closed；production Projection index remains empty，因此当前没有 Skill-bearing release selection/admission”。同页 `M14-SURFACE-001` 仍写 public docs 留给 M14-004，`M14-DOCS-001` 仍带完成提案待验收语气，`M14-GOV-001` 仍写等待 M14-002/005；建议同步为当前 accepted truth。\n\n2. **把 M14-005 下一阶段拆开写清楚。** 当前 STATUS/ROADMAP/TASKS 派生摘要主要写“readiness R2 + named Human release decision”是剩余项，容易让后续实现者误读成 Human decision 后即可直接 release。建议明确分两层：\n   - external readiness remaining：本 PR R2 接受 + fresh ruleset readback + named Human release decision；\n   - then M14-005 implementation：protected source-CI attestation、release-only workflow/checks、atomic topology cutover、freeze exact develop source/current main parent、deterministic projection / prospective-tree equality、first curated release / tag-artifact closure。\n\n以上均不要求改 Runtime、release architecture 或本轮许可实现。技术上我认为 #78 可以继续进入 cross-owner R2 review；当前还缺 `let778750-cpu` 对 exact head 的 fresh review。",
